DESCRIPTION:National Nachos Day falls on November 6 and marks a dish with a
  well-documented inventor and an undocumented holiday. Nachos take their n
 ame from Ignacio "Nacho" Anaya\, who improvised them at a restaurant on th
 e Mexican side of the Texas border\, and they became a stadium fixture thr
 ee decades later because a San Antonio businessman worked out how to pump 
 cheese. Who chose November 6\, and when\, is not recorded in any source th
 at can be checked.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/national-nachos-
 day/
